+	 * %SCX_ENQ_LAST and %SCX_ENQ_LOCAL flags set.
+	 *
+	 * If the BPF scheduler wants to continue executing the task,
+	 * ops.enqueue() should dispatch the task to %SCX_DSQ_LOCAL immediately.
